# GForge allowlist for this repository.
# The scanner's own source and test suite intentionally contain secret-shaped
# patterns and fake fixtures (example provider tokens, a sample DB password)
# used to define and exercise detection.
^src/scanner\.js$
^test/scanner\.test\.js$
# The README documents what a secret looks like and walks through a demo commit
# that stages a fake credential, so it is secret-shaped by design.
^README\.md$
